      "widgets_values": [
        "Identify the target by scene position + clothing, not just \"the man\" when several men appear. Example: \"the man on the left in the gray jacket\" -> \"the man shown in group A\". Other people remain in the prompt. Labels/purposes guide the model; they are not hard regional or attribute constraints. This graph edits the full scene. For exact background/other-person preservation, use workflow 07's crop/composite structure. 1.5 MP is the default; output aspect automatically follows the uploaded scene. Keep the existing Turbo BF16, Identity Edit, FIT, 1/4 strengths and screenshot rebalancer. No new models or API calls."
